{
    "title": "Super Jigsaw - HD Puzzle Games",
    "description": "Super Jigsaw is a free HD jigsaw puzzle game for adults, with over 10,000+ HD jigsaw puzzles available for free. Enjoy daily updates of jigsaw puzzle pictures and receive updates for hundreds of new jigsaw puzzle games weekly. It's good for brain exercise, promoting logical thinking and memory skills.\r\n\r\nOur free jigsaw puzzles game contains thousands of high-quality HD puzzles in a wide variety of collections, whether you prefer beautiful landscapes, lovely animals, or intricate patterns, we have a puzzle to suit your taste. The jigsaw puzzles game difficulty is based on the number of picture puzzle pieces, which should be put together.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n* Extensive Puzzle Library: Choose from a wide range of beautiful images across various categories.\r\n* Daily Challenges: Enjoy a fresh, new puzzle every day and earn rewards for completing them.\r\n* Customizable Difficulty: Adjust the number of pieces to match your skill level, from easy 36-piece puzzles to mind-boggling 400-piece challenges.\r\n* Intuitive Controls: Drag and drop pieces effortlessly with smooth touch controls designed for a seamless experience.\r\n* Helpful Tools: Utilize handy features like edge sorting and preview mode to streamline your puzzle-solving process.\r\n* Custom background: Choose a comfortable background to solve free jigsaw puzzle games with more pleasure.\r\n* Helpful Hints: Use Hint to match the next piece to the Jigsaw puzzle if you are stuck.\r\n* Progress Tracking: Keep track of your achievements and completion times for each puzzle to challenge yourself and improve your skills.\r\n\r\nWith its sleek design and user-friendly interface, Super Jigsaw App provides hours of fun. Unleash your inner puzzler and start assembling beautiful pictures piece by piece. Download now and embark on a mesmerizing puzzle adventure!\r\n\r\nSuper Jigsaw starts with a free plan, and you can easily upgrade. If you choose to purchase a subscription, payment will be charged to your Apple\u2019s App Store account, and your account will be charged within 24-hours prior to the end of the current period. Auto-renewal may be turned off at any time. For more information, please visit our Privacy Policy(https://superjigsaw.com/privacy-policy.html) and Terms of Use(https://superjigsaw.com/terms-of-use.html).\r\n\r\nLove Super Jigsaw? Leave us a 5-star review and all your feedback will be appreciated.\r\nFor feature requests or further feedback, please send us an email to superjigsawapp@gmail.com.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Super Jigsaw is a free HD jigsaw puzzle game for adults, with over 10,000+ HD jigsaw puzzles available for free. Enjoy daily updates of jigsaw puzzle pictures and receive updates for hundreds of new jigsaw puzzle games weekly. It&#39;s good for brain exercise, promoting logical thinking and memory skills.<br><br>Our free jigsaw puzzles game contains thousands of high-quality HD puzzles in a wide variety of collections, whether you prefer beautiful landscapes, lovely animals, or intricate patterns, we have a puzzle to suit your taste. The jigsaw puzzles game difficulty is based on the number of picture puzzle pieces, which should be put together.<br><br>Key Features:<br>* Extensive Puzzle Library: Choose from a wide range of beautiful images across various categories.<br>* Daily Challenges: Enjoy a fresh, new puzzle every day and earn rewards for completing them.<br>* Customizable Difficulty: Adjust the number of pieces to match your skill level, from easy 36-piece puzzles to mind-boggling 400-piece challenges.<br>* Intuitive Controls: Drag and drop pieces effortlessly with smooth touch controls designed for a seamless experience.<br>* Helpful Tools: Utilize handy features like edge sorting and preview mode to streamline your puzzle-solving process.<br>* Custom background: Choose a comfortable background to solve free jigsaw puzzle games with more pleasure.<br>* Helpful Hints: Use Hint to match the next piece to the Jigsaw puzzle if you are stuck.<br>* Progress Tracking: Keep track of your achievements and completion times for each puzzle to challenge yourself and improve your skills.<br><br>With its sleek design and user-friendly interface, Super Jigsaw App provides hours of fun. Unleash your inner puzzler and start assembling beautiful pictures piece by piece. Download now and embark on a mesmerizing puzzle adventure!<br><br>Super Jigsaw starts with a free plan, and you can easily upgrade. If you choose to purchase a subscription, payment will be charged to your Apple\u2019s App Store account, and your account will be charged within 24-hours prior to the end of the current period. Auto-renewal may be turned off at any time. For more information, please visit our Privacy Policy(https://superjigsaw.com/privacy-policy.html) and Terms of Use(https://superjigsaw.com/terms-of-use.html).<br><br>Love Super Jigsaw? Leave us a 5-star review and all your feedback will be appreciated.<br>For feature requests or further feedback, please send us an email to superjigsawapp@gmail.com.",
